singbox-docker

This project provides a Docker-oriented management script for sing-box.

Upstream projects and references:

- SagerNet/sing-box: https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box
- 233boy/sing-box: https://github.com/233boy/sing-box

The runtime uses the official SagerNet sing-box container image by default.
The interactive management flow is inspired by the one-click script style of
233boy/sing-box.

Users and distributors must comply with the licenses of the upstream projects
and any third-party software installed or invoked by this script.
